[SIZE=6][B]MC Macro Mod - Release Notes[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.0.6[/B][/SIZE]

### 🚀 Package Migration, Type-Safe Scripting Engine & Library Overhaul
[LIST]
[*][B]Package Namespace Migration:[/B] Refactored all Java classes, plugin descriptors ([CODE]fabric.mod.json[/CODE], [CODE]plugin.yml[/CODE], [CODE]paper-plugin.yml[/CODE], [CODE]bungee.yml[/CODE], [CODE]velocity-plugin.json[/CODE]), scripts, and build configs to [CODE]com.github.secondlifegaming.macromod[/CODE].
[*][B]Type-Safe Variable Model ([CODE]ScriptValue[/CODE]):[/B] Replaced split disconnected maps with a unified, type-safe [CODE]ScriptValue[/CODE] model ([CODE]NUMBER[/CODE], [CODE]STRING[/CODE], [CODE]BOOLEAN[/CODE], [CODE]ARRAY[/CODE]), eliminating variable shadowing bugs.
[*][B]Parameterized [CODE]INC[/CODE] & [CODE]DEC[/CODE]:[/B] Updated [CODE]inc[/CODE] and [CODE]dec[/CODE] to support optional custom step values: [CODE]inc counter 5[/CODE], [CODE]inc counter $step[/CODE], [CODE]dec health 10[/CODE].
[*][B]Native Math Instructions:[/B] Added native arithmetic operations [CODE]add[/CODE], [CODE]sub[/CODE] / [CODE]subtract[/CODE], [CODE]mul[/CODE] / [CODE]multiply[/CODE], [CODE]div[/CODE] / [CODE]divide[/CODE], and [CODE]mod[/CODE].
[*][B]String & Array Functions:[/B] Added string manipulation ([CODE]concat[/CODE], [CODE]substr[/CODE], [CODE]length[/CODE], [CODE]lower[/CODE], [CODE]upper[/CODE]) and array management ([CODE]arraypush[/CODE], [CODE]arraypop[/CODE], [CODE]arrayclear[/CODE], [CODE]arraycontains[/CODE]).
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.0.5[/B][/SIZE]
[I][B]Note:[/B] Version 0.0.5 marks the final alpha development milestone. MacroMod and the macromod-server companion ecosystem are feature-complete and preparing for upcoming public Beta releases.[/I]

### 🚀 Enhancements, Inventory Automation & Engine Lifecycle Stability
[LIST]
[*][B]Automated Container Stashing:[/B] Introduced [CODE]{STASHALL}[/CODE] keyword to deposit main player inventory items into open containers while protecting hotbar tools (pickaxes & shovels).
[*][B]Screen Lifecycle & Container Sync Fixes:[/B] Refactored [CODE]{CLOSESCREEN}[/CODE] to invoke [CODE]Screen.onClose()[/CODE], properly triggering container close packets and preventing overlay lockups on automated vault sequences.
[*][B]Hotbar Slot Packet Sync:[/B] Updated [CODE]{SLOT 1..9}[/CODE] to convert 1-based numbers to 0-based indices (0..8) and send explicit [CODE]ServerboundSetCarriedItemPacket[/CODE] network packets to synchronize hotbar slot changes with the server.
[*][B]File Array Operations & Chat Formatting:[/B] Introduced [CODE]{READFILE}[/CODE], [CODE]{ARRAYSIZE}[/CODE], and [CODE]{GETARRAY}[/CODE] for reading and indexing text file arrays, plus [CODE]{CHAT}[/CODE] with color code translation ([CODE]&a[/CODE] -> [CODE]§a[/CODE]).
[*][B]Thread Safety & Single-Slot Actions:[/B] Pinned outbound commands ([CODE]sendCommand[/CODE]) and chat ([CODE]sendChat[/CODE]) to Minecraft's main client thread. Added single-slot actions [CODE]{SLOTCLICK}[/CODE], [CODE]{SHIFTCLICK}[/CODE], [CODE]{CTRLSHIFTCLICK}[/CODE], [CODE]{QUICKMOVE}[/CODE], [CODE]{QUICKMOVEALL slot}[/CODE], and [CODE]{CONTAINERCLICK}[/CODE] for precise slot manipulation.
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.0.4[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]🚀 Security, Event Triggers & Server Policy Integration[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Security & Sandbox Hardening:[/B] Blocked dangerous reflection/process lookup prefixes ([CODE]java.[/CODE], [CODE]javax.[/CODE], [CODE]sun.[/CODE], [CODE]Runtime[/CODE], [CODE]ProcessBuilder[/CODE]). Added [CODE]Throwable[/CODE] isolation in [CODE]ScriptInterpreter.tick()[/CODE].
[*][B]New Event Triggers & Movement:[/B] Added [CODE]onItemPickup[/CODE], [CODE]onInventoryChange[/CODE], [CODE]onWorldLoad[/CODE], off-hand durability thresholding, and priority script suspension/resumption.
[*][B]DSL & API Extensions:[/B] Added [CODE]$isburning[/CODE], [CODE]$isswimming[/CODE], [CODE]$eyeheight[/CODE], inventory query actions ([CODE]{INVENTORYGETSLOT}[/CODE], [CODE]{GETHELDITEM}[/CODE], [CODE]{SWAPSLOT}[/CODE]), loop [CODE]break[/CODE]/[CODE]continue[/CODE], and string condition equality checks ([CODE]if $dimension == "minecraft:the_nether"[/CODE]).
[*][B]Server Policy & Network Integration:[/B] Registered [CODE]macromod:policy[/CODE] custom payload handler in [CODE]ServerPermissionHandler[/CODE], added LuckPerms meta-key integration ([CODE]macromod.<flag>[/CODE]), and initialized companion server plugin workspace [CODE]macromod-server[/CODE].
[*][B]Build Pipeline & Automation:[/B] Multi-artifact build script [CODE]scripts/build.sh[/CODE] packaging free, premium, and universal server JARs.
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.0.3[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]🚀 Enhancements & New Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Emergency Kill Switch (K Key) & Key Release Safety:[/B] Pressing [B]K[/B], stopping scripts, or toggling off macros automatically stops execution and [B]releases all held down keys[/B] ([CODE]keyAttack[/CODE], [CODE]keyLeft[/CODE], etc.).
[*][B]Overlay GUI Key re-bound to M:[/B] Default overlay GUI key moved to [B]M[/B] to avoid key conflicts.
[*][B]Script Editor Line Reordering:[/B] Added [B]▲ Move Up[/B] and [B]▼ Move Down[/B] buttons to every script editor line.
[*][B]Random Looking & Variable Commands:[/B] Added [CODE]{LOOKRANGE minYaw maxYaw minPitch maxPitch}[/CODE] (min/max bounds), [CODE]{LOOKRANDOM}[/CODE] / [CODE]{LOOKVARIANCE}[/CODE] (center ± spread), [CODE]{WAITRANDOM}[/CODE], [CODE]random var min max[/CODE], and [CODE]$random[/CODE] variable.
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]Version 0.0.2[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=4][B]🚀 Enhancements & New Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Automated Dual-Edition Build Pipeline:[/B] Configured Gradle [CODE]BuildConfig[/CODE] generator and build flags to compile both Free ([CODE]macromod-0.0.2-free.jar[/CODE]) and Premium ([CODE]macromod-0.0.2-premium.jar[/CODE]) editions automatically.
[*][B]Expanded Scripting Variables Engine:[/B] Added read-only variables for experience ([CODE]$level[/CODE], [CODE]$xp[/CODE], [CODE]$xpprogress[/CODE], [CODE]$xppercent[/CODE]), oxygen supply ([CODE]$air[/CODE], [CODE]$oxygen[/CODE], [CODE]$maxair[/CODE]), saturation ([CODE]$saturation[/CODE]), armor ([CODE]$armor[/CODE]), orientation ([CODE]$facing[/CODE], [CODE]$direction[/CODE]), gamemode ([CODE]$gamemode[/CODE]), difficulty ([CODE]$difficulty[/CODE]), weather ([CODE]$weather[/CODE], [CODE]$isthundering[/CODE]), player state booleans ([CODE]$underwater[/CODE], [CODE]$onground[/CODE], [CODE]$isriding[/CODE], [CODE]$issneaking[/CODE], [CODE]$issprinting[/CODE], [CODE]$isflying[/CODE]), and username ([CODE]$playername[/CODE]).
[*][B]New Event Trigger Hooks:[/B] Added Low Air (% threshold) and Low XP Level (level threshold) automated event triggers.
[*][B]Official Premium Messaging:[/B] Added official website URL [URL='https://mc-macro-mod.web.app/']https://mc-macro-mod.web.app/[/URL] to all premium warning notices.
[*][B]Code Quality:[/B] Fully refactored [CODE]ScriptInterpreter.java[/CODE] for zero Sonar warnings and reduced cognitive complexity.
[/LIST]

[CENTER]----------------------------------------------------------------[/CENTER]

